    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc96 ADD OUR GAMES TO YOUR WISHLIST \ud83d\udc96</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/cad06fc41403ffc9f6022411bd620695.avif?t=1754922955\" width=616 height=224 /></span></p></p><br><h1>\ud83d\udd25HOT MILFS ARE WAITING FOR YOU!!! \ud83d\udd25 \u2764\ufe0fTAKE YOUR PLACE, THEY WON'T WAIT FOREVER!! \u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/daa735868f3773a2400950bb3126d812.avif?t=1754922955\" width=616 height=199 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/5581dfd0de50348cbaeb2061548c414e.avif?t=1754922955\" data-has-big width=800 height=237 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to our hotel, where anyone could be a guest. Ghost? Ancient deity? Character from a famous fairy tale? But the staff here is not so ordinary either.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/1707e1b016056e294832e65a6e20a90a.poster.avif?t=1754922955\" width=622 height=241 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/1707e1b016056e294832e65a6e20a90a.webm?t=1754922955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From now on, you are a new employee of this hotel. A friendly team and interesting tasks to keep you waiting for more. Your job description? Be ready to become a jack of all trades!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/af38dabc8f08c5912e8930377480bce6.poster.avif?t=1754922955\" width=621 height=241 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/af38dabc8f08c5912e8930377480bce6.webm?t=1754922955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everybody here has their own story, everybody has a skeleton in their closet (apart from Jeff from room 7 - because he is the skeleton). Learn more about the scary fairytales within the walls of the most friendly hotel in all the worlds!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/c5bc3ecd03b5cc8f6acae64a5fe33ac0.poster.avif?t=1754922955\" width=620 height=241 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/c5bc3ecd03b5cc8f6acae64a5fe33ac0.webm?t=1754922955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And keep in mind: the most important thing is to pass the probationary period. From there on, it will definitely get easier!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join in the hotel</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check-in: choose a suitable room, according to the preferences and special requests of the guests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Room Service: deliver food, run errands, and help with guests' hotel-related problems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conflict management: resolve disputes between guests or employees, this will affect their attitude towards you and each other.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactivity</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guest engagement: requests range from cooking unique meals (e.g. custom potion orders) to helping find lost items (or even guests!) in rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entertainment activities: dinner with visitors and staff, weekend adventures with friends, opportunities to be a photographer and gather a sticker collection.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social interactions</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developing relationships with your colleagues, from platonic to romantic. Each character has its own story. How each character story reveals - depends only on you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The decisions that you make during the working day determine not only the story, but also the ending of the game.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of endings</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different endings depend on how you fulfill your duties, your relationships, and your key choices in certain moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diversity of endings: romantic outcomes, revealing the secrets of the hotel, or even its destruction (if everything goes wrong). Experience them all! </p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/24f21aeb920d665c62bdfaaea6304320.avif?t=1754922955\" width=620 height=300 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/5581dfd0de50348cbaeb2061548c414e.avif?t=1754922955\" data-has-big width=800 height=237 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to our hotel, where anyone could be a guest. Ghost? Ancient deity? Character from a famous fairy tale? But the staff here is not so ordinary either.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/1707e1b016056e294832e65a6e20a90a.poster.avif?t=1754922955\" width=622 height=241 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/1707e1b016056e294832e65a6e20a90a.webm?t=1754922955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From now on, you are a new employee of this hotel. A friendly team and interesting tasks to keep you waiting for more. Your job description? Be ready to become a jack of all trades!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/af38dabc8f08c5912e8930377480bce6.poster.avif?t=1754922955\" width=621 height=241 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/af38dabc8f08c5912e8930377480bce6.webm?t=1754922955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everybody here has their own story, everybody has a skeleton in their closet (apart from Jeff from room 7 - because he is the skeleton). Learn more about the scary fairytales within the walls of the most friendly hotel in all the worlds!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/c5bc3ecd03b5cc8f6acae64a5fe33ac0.poster.avif?t=1754922955\" width=620 height=241 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/c5bc3ecd03b5cc8f6acae64a5fe33ac0.webm?t=1754922955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And keep in mind: the most important thing is to pass the probationary period. From there on, it will definitely get easier!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join in the hotel</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check-in: choose a suitable room, according to the preferences and special requests of the guests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Room Service: deliver food, run errands, and help with guests' hotel-related problems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conflict management: resolve disputes between guests or employees, this will affect their attitude towards you and each other.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactivity</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guest engagement: requests range from cooking unique meals (e.g. custom potion orders) to helping find lost items (or even guests!) in rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entertainment activities: dinner with visitors and staff, weekend adventures with friends, opportunities to be a photographer and gather a sticker collection.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social interactions</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developing relationships with your colleagues, from platonic to romantic. Each character has its own story. How each character story reveals - depends only on you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The decisions that you make during the working day determine not only the story, but also the ending of the game.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of endings</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different endings depend on how you fulfill your duties, your relationships, and your key choices in certain moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diversity of endings: romantic outcomes, revealing the secrets of the hotel, or even its destruction (if everything goes wrong). Experience them all! </p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3413800/extras/24f21aeb920d665c62bdfaaea6304320.avif?t=1754922955\" width=620 height=300 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Hotel Tales is a mystery hotel manager set in the crossroads between worlds. Dive into the amazing, frightening and funny stories of guests and colleagues, discover the hotel's secrets and try to survive at least to the end of your probationary period!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Polish, Turkish, Thai, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
